["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"297: Why Teens Lie—and How to Respond Without Escalating Haim Ginott smell test perspective game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-asklisa-心理学家-教孩子对同伴撒谎自保-好过逞强说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fae74bb25cb36023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>心理学家：教孩子对同伴撒谎自保，好过逞强说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">面对同伴怂恿抽大麻之类的场合，她宁可教孩子说一句谎把责任推给父母脱身，也不要孩子因找不到体面拒绝方式而冒险——目标是安全优先，不是诚实至上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年教育</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loud, Messy, Physical - What To Do When Kids Won&#x27;t Stop Fighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-unruffled-孩子打架别急着拉开-冲突本身就是他们在学社交/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架别急着拉开：冲突本身就是他们在学社交</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">频繁的尖叫、撕咬甚至打你一巴掌，往往不是孩子出了问题，而是父母越介入，冲突就越容易变成孩子们抢夺「妈妈注意力」的戏码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">手足冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258｜聊聊硅谷创业“修道院”HF0与OpenRouter早期故事 spray and pray subtraction Demo Dinner unified interface for LLMs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-sv101-以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客-学到的却是只做一件事的减法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">54:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客，学到的却是只做一件事的减法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人说最难的减法不是去掉不重要的娱乐，而是只盯住对公司最重要的那件事，甚至排除掉第二重要的事情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">HF0</span><span class=\"tag\">孵化器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"151 ✪ 从「需要」到「想要」：中国时尚品牌集体向上 lookbook intangible assets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-fengtouquan-消费降级论被打脸-千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>消费降级论被打脸：千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天猫数据显示，客单价1500至2000元的轻奢价位国货品牌，今年成交增速是整个服装电商大盘的六倍，消费者正在为向往感而非性价比买单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时尚品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">电商经营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"512 – Oops, All Henrys exchequer investiture controversy homage mark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-britishhist-把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝-英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝：英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利把6岁的女儿许配给靠软禁父亲上位的德意志国王，为此开出的一万马克聘金，与鲁弗斯当年卖掉整个诺曼底公国的价码完全相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">王室联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">封建效忠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen and His Spy Romeo Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控-仍放行48亿美元芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b361072bd3e2fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控，仍放行48亿美元芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商务部早已掌握Megaspeed由中国间谍运营的情报，仍选择不执行本可阻断其芯片供应的既有规定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Frontier Labs Buy: A Data Deep Dive with Handshake AI — Garrett Lord &amp; Team RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) reward hacking redlining Care Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-latentspace-银行家宁可从零重做-也不愿修改ai给出的95-正确答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1b6b68e7fa0afc2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>银行家宁可从零重做，也不愿修改AI给出的95%正确答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修复一个95%正确的AI输出，花的时间和从零开始一样多，因为错误藏在公式与判断的细节里，而非表层格式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据标注</span><span class=\"tag\">金融建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国，死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、两次加冕法国王后，用婚姻条款逼法国承认布列塔尼的独立地位，但她死后国王还是违背她的遗愿，把布列塔尼并入了法国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申请走完所有流程后，纸质件要被送进宾夕法尼亚一座废弃石灰岩矿洞人工归档——卡住它的不是技术，是没人愿意为改善系统去承担被国会问责的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Retelling history in art and drama Joint Stock corpsing Boko Haram\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-startweek-今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守-不是更开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守，不是更开放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《云的九种形态》导演坦言：如今英国新剧远比1970年代更拘谨，复排时特意将后半段处理成一出年代戏，因为那种坦率尺度已经回不去了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民历史</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧改编</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"宏观经济如何传导给我们每个人？ R&lt;G convenience yield paradox of thrift negative beta\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-mianji-这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题-根源是ai资本开支狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df0264fae5d8abe9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题，根源是AI资本开支狂潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国扩大AI资本开支推高投资、股市繁荣拉动消费，储蓄降、投资升，这才是本轮全球失衡加剧的真正驱动力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观经济</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is How New York City Takes Out Its Trash Empire bin ASL truck Defensible Space\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-oddlots-纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用-政府花10个月自己设计了一辆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用：政府花10个月自己设计了一辆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为没有适合纽约街道的自动侧装卡车，抄欧洲方案又要等五年，纽约市环卫局干脆亲自下场把车设计出来，只用了十个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">垃圾处理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#415 ‒ AMA #91: Understanding lab testing: what blood work can and cannot tell you about your health and disease risk DTC testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-thepeterattiad-血检再全面-也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>血检再全面，也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peter Attia在这期AMA里给出一个具体数字：即便是最全面的血液检测，也只能提供他评估患者风险所需信息的25%到30%，剩下的需要靠影像、体成分和纵向追踪补齐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">血液检测</span><span class=\"tag\">健康风险评估</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Cooking!? What Should Dems Do Next + Jensen&#x27;s Affair MSS MATCH Act Section 232 USMCA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-得州州长选举爆冷-反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ba219ec92b9bc66-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>得州州长选举爆冷，反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反数据中心情绪从来不是「自由派恨科技」的故事，而是跨党派共识，已经强到能掀翻一场州长选举、让华尔街措手不及地蒸发巨额市值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Deep Dive on Submarines X-Craft bathyscaphe SSN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-historyhit-击沉贝尔格拉诺号前-副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6775897482174464-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">51:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>击沉贝尔格拉诺号前，副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">核潜艇「征服者」号击沉阿根廷巡洋舰贝尔格拉诺号前，副指挥官麦克莱蒙曾在控制室喝止艇长，只为等一个更好的射击角度——那是英国潜艇自二战以来首次真正开火。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">潜艇史</span><span class=\"tag\">二战海战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"721. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Outbreak of The Crimean War (Part 1) sublime port plunger cavalry drawl black bottle affair sick man of Europe\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-restishistory-克里米亚战争真正的导火索-只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/607aa1e9567d043b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>克里米亚战争真正的导火索，只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">克里米亚战争由伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争点燃，英法俄三大国在互相猜忌和误判中，像后来的一战列强一样梦游般卷入了这场冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">维多利亚时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Cisco Got Bullwhipped Bullwhip effect Virtual close Extranet Keiretsu Vendor financing Contract manufacturer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-asianometry-思科自夸能实时看清全球需求-其实看到的是客户重复下的订单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">31:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>思科自夸能实时看清全球需求，其实看到的是客户重复下的订单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">思科两个季度库存分别暴涨87%和58.8%，根源不是需求爆发，而是客户为抢缺货重复下单，又被「实时供应链」原样放大转发给了上游。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">供应链管理</span><span class=\"tag\">牛鞭效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"411. Lawrence of Arabia: The Truth Behind The Legend (Part 1) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Carchemish Wilderness of Zin Arab Bureau McMahon-Hussein Correspondence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-empirehist-阿拉伯的劳伦斯私下写道-犹太人耕种的农场才是沙漠里的亮点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">54:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>阿拉伯的劳伦斯私下写道：犹太人耕种的农场才是沙漠里的亮点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劳伦斯以「阿拉伯解放者」留名青史，但他亲眼见证巴勒斯坦的犹太移民农场后，写下的却是「犹太人耕种得越快越好」，这与后世赋予他的形象形成巨大反差。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">一战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"[One Million AI Engineer Special] How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco RPI framework sub-agent God box context engineering software factory Manager of Agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-latentspace-ai让新工程师入职门槛直逼高级工程师水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb1a6f8e94a7eb56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>AI让新工程师入职门槛直逼高级工程师水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI工具已经把基础代码工作做得足够好，企业现在要的是能做架构决策和设计取舍的人，所以新毕业生的技能标准被整体拉高了一级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">工程教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why PMs are suddenly valuable again | Tulsee Doshi (Head of Product, Gemini) harness Pareto curve of cost to quality chain of thought monitoring flash teams Monk skin tone scale Fitzpatrick scale\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-lennys-人人都能一键开发时-pm的核心价值变成了审美与取舍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b981f0ab567ea7c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">58:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>人人都能一键开发时，PM的核心价值变成了审美与取舍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型人人能调，能跑起来的东西不再稀缺；能从一堆能做的事里挑出真正值得做的那一件，才是PM重新被需要的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 503 Free Market: Dutch Capitalism VOC WIC mercantilism amour propre stadtholder joint-stock company\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-hopwag-荷兰资本主义不是新教伦理的产物-而是中世纪经济自然演化的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>荷兰资本主义不是新教伦理的产物，而是中世纪经济自然演化的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济史学家如今认为，加尔文教与资本主义是在荷兰自由土壤里平行生长、彼此强化，而非新教伦理催生了资本主义精神。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资本主义史</span><span class=\"tag\">荷兰共和国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1373: Challenging Dengue and RIGging Flu ADE (antibody-dependent enhancement) EDE (envelope dimer epitope) RIG-I RNAemia Pol III non-coding RNA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-twiv-登革疫苗挑战试验发现-病毒复制太猛或太弱都练不出持久免疫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>登革疫苗挑战试验发现：病毒复制太猛或太弱都练不出持久免疫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二次登革感染中病毒载量适中者免疫记忆最强，载量过高反而因IL-12驱动的短命抗体而更快失效，打破了复制越少越安全的直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">登革热</span><span class=\"tag\">抗体依赖增强</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Year of Five Emperors donative Caesar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-ancients-罗马帝位争夺战-决定胜负的不是血统-而是离罗马有多近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38988d274dfcdf54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>罗马帝位争夺战：决定胜负的不是血统，而是离罗马有多近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">193年争夺罗马帝位的五人中，真正决定胜负的是消息传递速度——塞维鲁比对手早七天得知先帝遇刺的消息，便抢先起兵拿下帝位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">帝位继承</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Is THIS the AI We Want? Alarming Acceleration, AI Election Bets, GPU Trading &amp; AI-Native VC Responsible Scaling Policy (RSP) BallotBench Move 37 HGX node PostTrainBench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-cogrev-anthropic研发加速已证实-推手不是算力-是算法和数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec28c976f21f448e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic研发加速已证实：推手不是算力，是算法和数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic在IPO文件中承认研发可能已经「戏剧性加速」，METR的独立评估显示：这波提速靠的不是更多算力，而是算法和数据质量本身被现有智能推着变好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>"]